To generate and sign:

1. Code Sign the EXE files:
   signtool sign /f YourCert.pfx /p PASSWORD /t http://timestamp.authority.com SnaglistPro-2.0.1-Installer.exe

2. Verify signature:
   signtool verify /a /pa SnaglistPro-2.0.1-Installer.exe

3. Generate full hashes:
   Get-FileHash SnaglistPro-2.0.1-Installer.exe -Algorithm SHA256 | Format-List

